Package: ggPSE
Title: Periodic Table Visualization Using ggplot2
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: person("Valentin", "Geiger", email = "geiger@westbor.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8794-2583"))
Description: A ggplot2-based toolkit for visualizing data on the periodic
    table of elements. Supports continuous color gradients, bubble size
    encoding, selective element highlighting, per-group or per-period plots,
    per-element charts and country-of-origin badges.
    Returns ggplot2 objects that can be further modified with standard
    ggplot2 syntax, including faceting and custom themes.
    Developed with AI assistance from Claude (Anthropic, 2026).
